Bundled Java runtime
--------------------

Native distributions generated by jpackage include the Java runtime legal files
under the packaged runtime's legal directory. Keep those files with the packaged
application.

Fonts
-----

- JetBrains Mono
  License: SIL Open Font License 1.1
  Source: https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono
  Used as the editor / code font. The TTFs are already bundled on the classpath by the
  JetBrains Jewel dependency (see above); nop loads them from there rather than vendoring a
  second copy, and falls back to the platform monospace if they are ever absent.

